From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zyang2 <zeyyang@cs.stonybrook.edu>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 09:44:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] lib: make the protocol module public

So that a separately verified client crate can import the Raft spec and
the ghost-log method (verus --export / --import): the crate root kept
the protocol module private, and only items reachable from the root are
exported. Visibility only; no definition changes.
---
 src/lib.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/lib.rs b/src/lib.rs
index e6d70830..03e54059 100644
--- a/src/lib.rs
+++ b/src/lib.rs
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ mod examples;
 mod generated;
 mod implementation;
 mod ports;
-mod protocol;
+pub mod protocol;
 mod services;
 mod verus_extra;
 
